So we have like this perfect storm of conspiracies,
the conspiracy ism and conspiracy theories

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:13.790
that are swirling around 5G mobile connectivity,
and it is now melding with the Corona virus

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:17.039
to create some amazing conspiracy theories.

00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:23.249
So let me catch you up on G 5 GS, the fifth
generation, as the name suggests, wireless

00:00:23.249 --> 00:00:27.300
communication technology and it has the potential
really to be a game changer.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.849
The download speeds for 5G are 1 to 2 in the
1 to 2 gigabit range depending on which country

00:00:31.849 --> 00:00:33.280
we're looking at.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.730
That is a level of throughput that could revolutionize
what's possible with mobile phones and mobile

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:38.730
devices.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.910
Applications connectivity really could be
a major game changer.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:47.140
Now, before coronavirus 5G has been one of
the fastest growing conspiracy theories, including

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:52.469
health related conspiracy theories, as well
as sort of government surveillance type stuff.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:59.489
The anti 5G activists have alleged on social
media and in various forums and blogs that

00:00:59.489 --> 00:01:01.539
5G can cause in fertility.

00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:10.330
It can cause cancer, it can cause autism,
Alzheimer's, the death of birds, sleep disruption,

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:13.510
hypoxia, just about everything in between.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:18.920
There is no solid evidence that mobile communications
networks harm human health.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:25.860
There is a seven year study on this that has
found no risks associated with the technology

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:29.270
that is used in 5G communications.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:34.760
And the old conspiracy theories more generally
about radio wave radiation are also being

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.580
revived around 5G.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:40.770
Despite those also having been extensively
researched and debunked over the last many

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:41.770
decades.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:47.670
So then we've got the 5G stuff incomes coronavirus
like like a rocket and a whole new slate of

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.450
conspiracy theories argued that the two are
connected.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.460
So I'll tell you about how this works.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:02:00.600
One of the theories is the real reason for
5G with its fast download speeds is to enable

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:04.570
mass live surveillance too in detail.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.280
Know exactly what every person on earth is
doing.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.310
Maybe governments are doing it.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.600
Maybe shadowy organisations are doing it.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:15.580
You combine this with corona virus and it
gets very, very crazy.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:18.860
So one idea is Corona virus originated in
China.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:22.359
China has recently turned down some 5G networks.

00:02:22.359 --> 00:02:25.780
So clearly the two are connected in some way.

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:29.180
Now, of course, there's no reason to actually
think that.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.720
But one thing that's important to understand
is that there are two types of 5G signals.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.030
There is what's called millimeter wave.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.760
And then there's the sub six gigahertz of
5G signals.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.920
The millimeter wave are the new ones.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:46.200
The sub six gigahertz ones are also what are
used for 4G.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.120
That's what's been turned on in China.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.709
So even at its face, it's ridiculous.

00:02:50.709 --> 00:02:53.459
But when you actually look at the details,
it doesn't make any sense.

00:02:53.459 --> 00:02:57.590
The 5G stuff turned on in China is the same
as the 4G stuff just faster.

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.200
That's been around for a long time.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:05.780
Another version of the 5G Corona virus conspiracy
suggests that the virus itself was released

