00:03:18.379 --> 00:03:23.780
This one's aggressively dumb because it's
not a secret that 5G is being rolled out and

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:27.870
then more generally there are all sorts of
kind of irresponsible, baseless allegations

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:33.030
like for example, those who are using 5G for
